Agastya begins Rāvaṇa clan and birth tale --- Pulastya practices austerities beside Mēru --- Sporting maidens disturb his hermitage --- Pulastya curses visitor to conceive --- Tr̥ṇabindu daughter enters unhearing and conceives --- Tr̥ṇabindu offers daughter as bride --- Pulastya accepts and promises lineage son --- Daughter bears Viśravas famed like father